<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" type="device"><diagram id="pg0" name="Regras de negócio"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1240" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="v1" value="PrimeCoding - Regras de negócio" style="text;html=1;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="700" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v2" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8EEF8;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="76" width="500" height="500" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v3" value="Catálogo e unidades" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="76" width="500" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v4" value="&lt;b&gt;RN01&lt;/b&gt; - A loja trabalha só com 3 modelos, um por linha: Entrada (ThinkPad T14 Gen 2), Intermediário (Dell Latitude 5430) e Pro (MacBook Air M2). O revendedor muda preço e estoque, mas não cria outra linha." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="126" width="480" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v5" value="&lt;b&gt;RN02&lt;/b&gt; - Cada notebook à venda é uma unidade única e revisada, com número de série, estado (A ou B), saúde da bateria e fotos reais." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="240" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v6" value="&lt;b&gt;RN03&lt;/b&gt; - Só vai para a vitrine unidade com bateria de pelo menos 80% de saúde. Abaixo disso, a bateria é trocada antes da venda." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="334" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v7" value="&lt;b&gt;RN04&lt;/b&gt; - Unidade em estado B, com marcas leves de uso, custa R$ 200 a menos que o preço da linha." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="428" width="480" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v8" value="&lt;b&gt;RN05&lt;/b&gt; - Modelo sem unidade disponível aparece como &quot;Esgotado&quot; e oferece &quot;Avise-me quando chegar&quot;." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="502" width="480" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v9" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBF0DC;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="76" width="500" height="312" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v10" value="Preço e pagamento" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="76" width="500" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v11" value="&lt;b&gt;RN06&lt;/b&gt; - O preço pode ser pago em até 12x sem juros no cartão ou no PIX com 10% de desconto." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="126" width="480" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v12" value="&lt;b&gt;RN07&lt;/b&gt; - O site não processa pagamento: o revendedor envia a chave PIX ou o link do cartão pela conversa do WhatsApp." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="200" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v13" value="&lt;b&gt;RN08&lt;/b&gt; - O preço de cada item (notebook e upgrade) fica gravado no pedido no momento em que ele é criado." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="294" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v14" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E6F2EA;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="76" width="500" height="574" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15" value="Pedido" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="76" width="500" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v16" value="&lt;b&gt;RN09&lt;/b&gt; - Para enviar o pedido é obrigatório informar nome, WhatsApp com DDD, CPF ou CNPJ para a nota fiscal e endereço completo. O e-mail é opcional." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="126" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v17" value="&lt;b&gt;RN10&lt;/b&gt; - O cliente não cria conta nem senha: é identificado pelo número de WhatsApp." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="220" width="480" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v18" value="&lt;b&gt;RN11&lt;/b&gt; - Todo notebook do pedido leva um kit de setup, sem custo: Estudante, Back-end, Front-end, Dados ou Mobile." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="294" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v19" value="&lt;b&gt;RN12&lt;/b&gt; - Cada notebook aceita no máximo 1 upgrade, e só os que o modelo permite. O MacBook Air não tem upgrade, porque memória e SSD são soldados." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="388" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v20" value="&lt;b&gt;RN13&lt;/b&gt; - Cada pedido aceita no máximo 3 notebooks." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="482" width="480" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v21" value="&lt;b&gt;RN14&lt;/b&gt; - Ao enviar, o sistema gera o código PC-AAAA-NNNN e abre o WhatsApp da loja com a mensagem pronta do pedido." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="556" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v22" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E8F5;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="690" width="500" height="426" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v23" value="Preparação e estoque" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="690" width="500" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v24" value="&lt;b&gt;RN15&lt;/b&gt; - A unidade escolhida fica reservada por 48 horas. Sem pagamento nesse prazo, o pedido é cancelado e a unidade volta para a vitrine." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="740" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v25" value="&lt;b&gt;RN16&lt;/b&gt; - Depois do pagamento, a preparação (revisão final, upgrade e kit de setup) leva até 2 dias úteis, ou 3 com upgrade." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="834" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v26" value="&lt;b&gt;RN17&lt;/b&gt; - O pedido segue a ordem: Aguardando atendimento, Aguardando pagamento, Em preparação, Pronto para envio, Enviado, Entregue. Pode ser cancelado até Em preparação, com devolução do valor se já foi pago." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="928" width="480" height="104" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v27" value="&lt;b&gt;RN18&lt;/b&gt; - Antes do envio, o revendedor manda pelo WhatsApp as fotos da unidade e o checklist da revisão." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="1042" width="480" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v28" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDE9E7;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="690" width="500" height="366" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v29" value="Entrega e garantia" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="690" width="500" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v30" value="&lt;b&gt;RN19&lt;/b&gt; - Frete grátis e com seguro para todo o Brasil, com o código de rastreio enviado pelo WhatsApp." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="740" width="480" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v31" value="&lt;b&gt;RN20&lt;/b&gt; - Garantia de 90 dias da loja para defeito de hardware. Queda, líquido e mau uso não entram." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="814" width="480" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v32" value="&lt;b&gt;RN21&lt;/b&gt; - Na garantia, o revendedor conserta ou troca por unidade equivalente em até 10 dias úteis." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="888" width="480" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v33" value="&lt;b&gt;RN22&lt;/b&gt; - O cliente pode desistir da compra em até 7 dias após o recebimento (art. 49 do Código de Defesa do Consumidor)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="590" y="962" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v34" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECECEC;strokeColor=#333333;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="690" width="500" height="406" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v35" value="Segurança e atendimento" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="690" width="500" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v36" value="&lt;b&gt;RN23&lt;/b&gt; - Para consultar um pedido ou acionar a garantia, o cliente informa o código e o WhatsApp do pedido. Os dois precisam bater." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="740" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v37" value="&lt;b&gt;RN24&lt;/b&gt; - Só o revendedor, com login e senha, acessa o painel. A senha é guardada criptografada (hash), nunca em texto puro." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="834" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v38" value="&lt;b&gt;RN25&lt;/b&gt; - Os dados do cliente servem só para venda, nota fiscal, entrega e garantia (LGPD)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="928" width="480" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v39" value="&lt;b&gt;RN26&lt;/b&gt; - Atendimento no WhatsApp de segunda a sábado, das 9h às 18h. Fora desse horário o site avisa que a resposta vem no próximo dia útil." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="1002" width="480" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="pg1" name="Fluxo do pedido"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1240" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="v1" value="Fluxo do pedido pelo WhatsApp (com as regras aplicadas)" style="text;html=1;fontSize=22;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="900" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v2" value="Cliente" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#333333;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="80" width="1570" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v3" value="Site PrimeCoding" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#333333;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="320" width="1570" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v4" value="Revendedor (WhatsApp)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#333333;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="630" width="1570" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v5" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#2B2D31;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="190" y="175" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v6" value="Escolhe o modelo, o kit de setup e, se quiser, um upgrade (RN11, RN12)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="260" y="150" width="200" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v7" value="Tem unidade&#xa;disponível?&#xa;(RN05)" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF6D8;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="290" y="385" width="140" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v8" value="Mostra &quot;Esgotado&quot; e oferece &quot;Avise-me quando chegar&quot;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="265" y="535" width="190" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v9" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#2B2D31;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="500" y="555" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v10" value="Preenche nome, WhatsApp, CPF ou CNPJ e endereço (RN09, RN13)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="140" width="230" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v11" value="Dados válidos?&#xa;(RN09, RN13)" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF6D8;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="610" y="390" width="130" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v12" value="Gera o código PC-AAAA-NNNN, grava os preços e reserva a unidade por 48 h (RN08, RN14, RN15)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="395" width="250" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v13" value="Abre o WhatsApp da loja com a mensagem pronta do pedido (RN14)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140" y="405" width="220" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v14" value="Confere o pedido, muda para &quot;Aguardando pagamento&quot; e envia PIX ou link do cartão (RN06, RN07)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1130" y="680" width="240" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v15" value="Pagou em até 48 h?&#xa;(RN15)" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF6D8;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="670" width="150" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v16" value="Cancela o pedido e devolve a unidade à vitrine (RN15)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="690" width="180" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v17" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#2B2D31;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="570" y="715" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v18" value="Em preparação: revisão final, upgrade e kit de setup (RN16)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="850" y="865" width="210" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v19" value="Pronto para envio: manda fotos e checklist pelo WhatsApp (RN18)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1110" y="865" width="220" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v20" value="Envia com seguro e manda o rastreio (RN19)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1110" y="960" width="220" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v21" value="Recebe o notebook pronto para programar; garantia de 90 dias e 7 dias para desistir (RN20, RN22)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1300" y="140" width="230" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="v22" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;shape=endState;fillColor=#2B2D31;strokeColor=#2B2D31;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="175" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e23" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edg